        "source_text_sha256": "97e06b715ec15879e9da76b05cd5250edc5df0b287c0736c121fbebff2f7fc41",
        "evidence_excerpt": "“Tell the pirate, Spartaco, that my ransom waits \nfor him,”’ replied Cesar in an undisturbed manner, \n“and then come to me.”",
