        "evidence_excerpt": "the corsairs were frequently defeated; what is really \nstrange is that they should have achieved so great \na success—success vouched for by the concrete \ninstance that they established those sinister dynas- \nties on the coast of Northern Africa which were \nthe outcome of their piratical activities.",
