      },
      {
        "finding_id": "section-35828146a7cbd73f1e33",
        "file": "india.history.resource.112019_112019_djvu.txt",
        "title": "Sea-Wolves of the Mediterranean: The Grand Period of the Moslem Corsairs",
        "url": "https://archive.org/details/india.history.resource.112019",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": "Currey, E. Hamilton",
          "date": [
            "1910-01-01T00:00:00Z"
          ],
          "source_type": null,
          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "02bcc5c0781b01bf6c6e78ee0d5b8bfb31a02ea35b47565b888e171e88ef6ad9",
        "evidence_excerpt": "THERE is, in the deeds of men of action, an in- \nterest which is never aroused by those persons of \nbrains and capacity by whom the world is really \nruled. The statesman in his cabinet is the god \nwithin the machine; it is he who directs the acts \nof nations, it is he who moves the fleets and \narmies as if they were pieces on the chess-board ; \nto him, as a rule, is the man of action subordinate, \nobeying his behests. Rule and governance are \nhis, power both in the abstract and the concrete. \nSeldom in the history of the world do we come \nacross the men who are at one and the same time \nstatesmen and soldiers, who, taking their destiny \nin their own hands, work it out to the appointed \nend thereof. But, as we stray in the by-paths of \nhistory, we meet with some who, in their day, have \ninfluenced not only the age in which they lived \nthemselves, but also the destinies of generations \nyet unborn. It would seem incredible that mere \npirates, such as the Moslem corsairs of the Medi- \nterranean, could be included in this category, and \nyet, as their story is unfolded, we shall see how \nthe Sea-wolves rose from the humblest beginnings \nto trouble the peace of Europe, to found for them-",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
          "url": "https://archive.org/details/india.history.resource.112019",
          "source_file": "india.history.resource.112019_112019_djvu.txt",
          "start_char": 27736,
          "end_char": 28935,
          "start_line": 946,
          "end_line": 969,
          "printed_page": null,
          "scan_indexes_0_based": [],
