        "evidence_excerpt": "There is a record in the Mémoires of the Rev. \nFrére Pierre d’An, Bachelier en Théologie de la \nFaculté de Paris, etc., who wrote in a most heart- \nfelt manner concerning the danger of the sea and \nthe perils to be expected from the Barbary corsairs. \nHe says, date 1637:",
