        "evidence_excerpt": "We have said that the real interest in the lives \nof the corsairs arose from the fact that it was \npersonal ascendancy, and that alone, which counted \nin the piratical hierarchy. Against Kheyr-ed- \nDin Barbarossa plots arose again and again, only \nto be defeated by the address of the man against \nwhom they were directed.",
