        "evidence_excerpt": "THE rise and progress of the Moslem corsairs of \nthe Mediterranean is a most curious and interesting \nhistorical fact. ‘The causes which led to results so \ndeplorable to commerce, civilisation, and Christianity \nare set forth in this chapter in order that some idea \nmay be formed of the state of affairs in that region \nat the end of the fifteenth and the beginning of the \nsixteenth centuries, and also that the reflex action \nof the great triumph of the Christian armies in \nSpain may be more fully understood.",
