        "source_text_sha256": "02bcc5c0781b01bf6c6e78ee0d5b8bfb31a02ea35b47565b888e171e88ef6ad9",
        "evidence_excerpt": "The maritime Christian States of the Medi- \nterranean at this epoch were at the height of their \npower and prosperity, but were faced by the might \nof the Ottoman Empire, against which they waged \nperpetual warfare. Bitter and unceasing was the \nstrife prosecuted by the Cross against the Crescent, \nand by the Crescent against the Cross; and riding \nlike eagles on the storm came the corsairs in their \nswift galleys ready to strike down the luckless \nargosy of the merchantman wheresoever she was \nto be met. But this was not all, as the shore as \nwell as the sea yielded up to them its tribute in the \nshape of slaves and booty, and Christian mothers",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
