        "source_text_sha256": "02bcc5c0781b01bf6c6e78ee0d5b8bfb31a02ea35b47565b888e171e88ef6ad9",
        "evidence_excerpt": "As the strong sun of a perfect May morning in \nthe Mediterranean leapt above the horizon, Uruj \nloosed his hounds upon their prey; the oars of \nthe galleys churned the clear blue waters into \nfoam, and the air was filled with the yells of the \ncorsairs. “ Allah! Allah!” and “ Barbarossa! Bar- \nbarossa!” they cried. It was a war-cry that was \ndestined to re-echo over many a conflict, both by \nland and sea, in the years that were to come.",
