      {
        "finding_id": "section-e044a91bfcfe1620fc1d",
        "file": "india.history.resource.112019_112019_djvu.txt",
        "title": "Sea-Wolves of the Mediterranean: The Grand Period of the Moslem Corsairs",
        "url": "https://archive.org/details/india.history.resource.112019",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": "Currey, E. Hamilton",
          "date": [
            "1910-01-01T00:00:00Z"
          ],
          "source_type": null,
          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "02bcc5c0781b01bf6c6e78ee0d5b8bfb31a02ea35b47565b888e171e88ef6ad9",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Freed from this rival, the Mitylene corsair had \nnow uncontested supremacy on the coast, a supre- \nmacy none was likely to contest in the future, as \nhe brooked no opposition, and had come to con- \nsider that independent piracy in the Mediterranean \nwas in some sort an infringement of the rights of \nhimself and his brother. One of the most salient \npeculiarities of the corsairs at this time was the \napparent recklessness with which they assailed \nothers who were participants in their nefarious \nbusiness. Self-interest and policy would seem, to \nthe observer in the present day, to have dictated \nquite a different course of action ; but we shall see, \nwhen we come to deal with the life-history of \nKheyr-ed-Din, that this infinitely wiser and more \nintellectual man apparently allowed himself to be \nswayed by gusts of passion, in which he savagely \nmaltreated those with whom he was associated, \nand from whom dangerous hostility was certainly \nto be feared if they escaped with their lives. At \nthis distance of time it is impossible to gauge the \nmotives by which men such as these were actuated, \nmore particularly in the case of Kheyr-ed-Din, \nwhose character was a blend of the deepest subtlety \nand calculated ferocity.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
          "url": "https://archive.org/details/india.history.resource.112019",
