        "evidence_excerpt": "Uruj was informed of all that was going on \nthrough his own spies, and, although he kept his \nfinger on the pulse of the conspiracy, he acted as \nthough the tribesmen were still his very faithful \nfriends and allies. The corsair was more patient \nthan his wont. In this affair he wished for ample",
