        "evidence_excerpt": "All this harmonised well with his reputation as a \nchief so resolute, so pitiless, that it was the boast \nof his followers that his very name shouted in \nbattle put to flight the Christian vessels. His \nsmile was fine and malicious, his speech facile, \nrevealing beneath the rude exterior of the corsair \nthe subtle man of affairs, who, from nothing, had \nmade himself King of Algiers, and was now, by the \ninvitation of Soliman the Magnificent, Admiralis- \nsimo of the Ottoman navy.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
