        "evidence_excerpt": "covenant that no corsair should use his ports for \nany purpose whatsoever, that the Emperor should \nnot only retain the Goletta but that all other \nfortified seaports should be put into his hands, that \nthe King of Tunis should in future pay twelve \nthousand crowns per annum ‘for the subsistence \nof the Spanish garrison of the Goletta, that he \nshould enter into no alliance with the enemies of \nthe Emperor, and should annually present, as an \nacknowledgment of his vassalage, six Moorish \nhorses, and six hawks.",
