        "evidence_excerpt": "greatest of the corsairs: accordingly, on July 25th \nCharles wrote to England, France, Portugal, Milan, \nFlorence, Venice, Genoa, Siena, Mantua, and \nNaples: “ De manera que en pocas dias se supo in \ntoda Europa su buena fortuna.” (So it was in a few \ndays the whole of Europe was acquainted with his \ngood fortune.)",
