        "evidence_excerpt": "“JT have forty galleys,” replied the corsair; \n“you have forty more. With these I will take the \nsea; but, mark you,” he continued, softening some- \nwhat, “ you do right to fear the displeasure of the \nSultan, and I also have no wish to encounter it; \nbut vessels raised and equipped in a hurry will be \nof small use to me. In the name of Allah the \ncompassionate and his holy Prophet give me my \neighty galleys and let me go.”",
