        "evidence_excerpt": "ed-Din at last yielded; the men were backing up \ntheir officers, a spirit of disaffection was abroad \nin the armada: such a thing as this a wise chief \nmust gauge at its true value, and stop before it \ngoes too far. The Osmanli were murmuring \nagainst “the corsair ”; it was time to let them see \nwhether they or their war-worn leader possessed \nthe greater wisdom.",
