      {
        "finding_id": "section-bdab0bd7dd95e550b73e",
        "file": "india.history.resource.112019_112019_djvu.txt",
        "title": "Sea-Wolves of the Mediterranean: The Grand Period of the Moslem Corsairs",
        "url": "https://archive.org/details/india.history.resource.112019",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": "Currey, E. Hamilton",
          "date": [
            "1910-01-01T00:00:00Z"
          ],
          "source_type": null,
          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "02bcc5c0781b01bf6c6e78ee0d5b8bfb31a02ea35b47565b888e171e88ef6ad9",
        "evidence_excerpt": "It is true that Doria was awkwardly situated ; \nKheyr-ed-Din held the interior position, and that \nleader was a great believer in the adage that “if \nBrag is a good dog, Holdfast is a better.” He \nwas well aware of his numerical inferiority, and in \nconsequence refused to listen to the frenzied appeals \nof the excited Moslems to be led against the \nChristian dogs. It may seem a contradiction in \nterms to speak of the moral courage of a pirate ; \nbut if ever that quality were displayed to its fullest \nextent it was exhibited by Barbarossa in the \nPrevesa campaign. In his intellectual outlook on \nall that was passing, both inside and outside of the \nGulf of Arta, in this September of 1538, we see \nKheyr-ed-Din at his best. Ever a fighter, he knew \nwhen to give battle and when to refrain, when to \nsweep headlong upon the foe, but also when to \nhold back and to baffle by waiting till the psycho- \nlogical moment should arrive. Around him Sinan- \nReis, Mourad-Reis, and half a hundred others of \ntheir kidney were clamouring; they hurled insults \nat his head, they heaped opprobrium on “the \ncorsair,” they practically incited their troops to \nmutiny in their mad appeals to be led against \nthe foe.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "EXPLICIT_PARAGRAPH",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
          "url": "https://archive.org/details/india.history.resource.112019",
          "source_file": "india.history.resource.112019_112019_djvu.txt",
          "start_char": 330957,
          "end_char": 332164,
