        "source_text_sha256": "02bcc5c0781b01bf6c6e78ee0d5b8bfb31a02ea35b47565b888e171e88ef6ad9",
        "evidence_excerpt": "“My ambition,” said the silver-tongued corsair, \n‘is to become a citizen of your great and beautiful \ncity. If you will admit me to its privileges it \nshall be my business to render you the richest \npeople in the whole Mediterranean, and your city \nthe most dreaded place in the world.”",
        "years_in_scope": [],
