        "evidence_excerpt": "The “ Africans,” however, were obdurate ; they \nknew a piraté when they saw him quite as well \nas any one else, and they were quite aware that, \nshould they open their gates to Dragut, sooner or \nlater they would have to stand a siege from the \nChristian forces, which was a thing they by no \nmeans desired.",
