      {
        "finding_id": "section-ae5a1c8d4ede4d844218",
        "file": "india.history.resource.112019_112019_djvu.txt",
        "title": "Sea-Wolves of the Mediterranean: The Grand Period of the Moslem Corsairs",
        "url": "https://archive.org/details/india.history.resource.112019",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": "Currey, E. Hamilton",
          "date": [
            "1910-01-01T00:00:00Z"
          ],
          "source_type": null,
          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "02bcc5c0781b01bf6c6e78ee0d5b8bfb31a02ea35b47565b888e171e88ef6ad9",
        "evidence_excerpt": "negative: the Council observed the outward forms \nof politeness to this formidable person who was \nspeaking them so fair: in reality, they hated and \nfeared the corsairs only one degree less than they \ndid Andrea Doria and his Christians. To admit \nthe one was to bring upon themselves the venge- \nance of the other; therefore if they could keep \nthem both out they intended so to do. ‘The \nill-omened courtesy of the corsair filled their hearts \nwith apprehension, and they viewed his immediate \ndeparture, after the refusal of the council had been \nconveyed to him, with undisguised relief. Had \nthey but known their man a little better, their \nuneasiness would have been far greater than their \njoy at his temporary absence. ‘Those things de- \nsired by Dragut which he could not obtain by \nfair means he usually seized by the strong hand ; \nand when he left so hurriedly, and at the same \ntime so unostentatiously, he had already entered \ninto a plot with Ibrahim Amburac. This leader, \nfurious at the rebuff which he had received at the \nhands of his fellow councillors on the subject of \nthe admittance of Dragut to the citizenship of \n“ Africa,” was now ready to deliver that city into \nthe hands of the corsairs by treachery.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
          "url": "https://archive.org/details/india.history.resource.112019",
          "source_file": "india.history.resource.112019_112019_djvu.txt",
