        "evidence_excerpt": "It must be remembered that the inhabitants of \nMehedia were by no means enamoured of Dragut- \nReis and his piratical followers: King Stork had \nsucceeded to King Log, the part of the former \nmonarch being taken by that singularly capable \nand ferocious person, Aisa, whose rule was far \nfrom being to the liking of the richer and more \nrespectable portion of the townsfolk.",
