        "source_text_sha256": "02bcc5c0781b01bf6c6e78ee0d5b8bfb31a02ea35b47565b888e171e88ef6ad9",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Whether or no this denunciation of Dragut had \nany influence on the Sultan it is impossible to say ; \nhe was in the habit of employing the corsairs, and \napparently cared nothing about their piratical \nreputation, so long as their depredations were \nconfined to Christian vessels. Shortly after the \nreceipt of the answer of Charles, however, the \nSultan conferred upon Dragut the title of Sand- \njak or governor of the island of Santa Maura, \nthus constituting him a Turkish official.",
