        "evidence_excerpt": "fortress much frequented by the corsairs; the \nGoletta at Tunis was also taken, and the pirates \nbecame so much alarmed that they demanded \nsuccour from Constantinople. They represented \nto Soliman that, at this rate, the whole of Northern \nAfrica would soon be in the hands of the Christians \nto the total exclusion of the true believer.",
