        "evidence_excerpt": "There is no object to be gained in lingering over \nthe earlier years of this notable corsair, as we should \nthus only be repeating what has been said about \nDragut, whose lieutenant and trusted follower he \nbecame. He accompanied his master to the siege \nof Malta, and when Dragut was slain the Capitan-",
