        "evidence_excerpt": "With the results to Europe of this amazing \nbattle we have nothing to {do in this book. That \nwhich it demonstrated, as far as the Sea-wolves \nwere concerned, was that they still remained the \nmost competent seamen and sea-fighters in the \nMediterranean, and that the legend of the invinci- \nbility of the Ottomans at sea rested on what had \nbeen accomplished during a long period of years by \nthese insatiable pirates and magnificent warriors.",
