        "source_text_sha256": "8f3c05c7515e4753fdbf1e6c89ebadf36b36a537f0572450eb8246a8822c8366",
        "evidence_excerpt": "A further reminder of the hazards ofa Eurocentric approach to the phe- \nnomenon of piracy is provided by Robert Antony in his study of interactions",
