        "source_text_sha256": "8f3c05c7515e4753fdbf1e6c89ebadf36b36a537f0572450eb8246a8822c8366",
        "evidence_excerpt": "inward integration, for example by reference to universals, such as shared \ncustoms, habits, or treaties.* In contrast, I will draw attention here to \nthe question of outward delimitation, or integration by exclusion. What \nis at issue here is the constitution of an international legal community \nthrough the conceptualization of the pirate as the common enemy of \nhumankind.",
