        "evidence_excerpt": "5 See Michael Kempe, “Beyond the Law. The Image of Piracy in the Legal Writings of Hugo \nGrotius,” in Property, Piracy and Punishment: Hugo Grotius on War and Booty in De iure praedae: \nConcepts and Contexts, ed. by Hans W. Blom (Leiden: Brill, 2009), 379-395. Also in: Grotiana",
