        "evidence_excerpt": "75 [Alexandre Olivier Exquemelin], Bucaniers of America: Or, a true Account of the Most remark- \nable Assaults Commited of late years upon the Coasts of The West-Indies [...] (London, 1684), \n33-39. On cooperation between pirates and the native Indian population, see also Ignacio J. \nGallup-Diaz, The Door ofthe Seas and the Key to the Universe: Indian Politics and Imperial Rivalry \nin the Daríén, 1640-1750 (New York: Columbia University Press, 2005), 53-74.",
