        "evidence_excerpt": "56 Bruce Buchan, “Pirate Oaths, Mutinous Murmurings, and British Counter-civilities at Sea \nin the Eighteenth Century,” Cultural History, 9, no. 1, (2020): 1-25.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
