        },
        "source_text_sha256": "8f3c05c7515e4753fdbf1e6c89ebadf36b36a537f0572450eb8246a8822c8366",
        "evidence_excerpt": "18 These petitions are analysed in great detail in my book, Subramanian, The Sovereign and \nthe Pirate.",
