        "source_text_sha256": "8f3c05c7515e4753fdbf1e6c89ebadf36b36a537f0572450eb8246a8822c8366",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Lakshmi Subramanian is currently a Visiting Professor of Humanities and \nSocial Sciences at BITS, Pilani-Goa, India. Her research expertise includes \nmaritime history, social, and economic history of modern India and a social \nhistory of music in twentieth-century India. Among her publications is \nThe Sovereign and the Pirate: Ordering Maritime Subjects in India's Western \nLittoral (2017).",
