        "source_text_sha256": "8f3c05c7515e4753fdbf1e6c89ebadf36b36a537f0572450eb8246a8822c8366",
        "evidence_excerpt": "In this short study, I have attempted to demonstrate how piracy was a \nsignificant component in the making ofthe Qing Empire and its legal regime. \nIset out to fill a hiatus in existing studies on the interrelationships between \nempire-building, sovereignty, and piracy by examining the internal dynam- \nics of China's Qing Empire between 1636 and 1911. Three overlapping and \ncompeting legal regimes developed at that time in China: first, that ofthe",
        "years_in_scope": [
          1636
        ],
