        "source_text_sha256": "8f3c05c7515e4753fdbf1e6c89ebadf36b36a537f0572450eb8246a8822c8366",
        "evidence_excerpt": "The definition of piracy has long been a matter of interest to philosophers \nand politicians alike. In this chapter, we consider the philosophical and \npolitical interest in piracy by focusing on a dissertation published in Uppsala, \nSweden, in 1716 by Magnus Thelaus (1687-1765), entitled: Dissertatio gradualis \nde piratica [On Piracy].' Of Thelaus himself very little is known, beyond the",
