        },
        "source_text_sha256": "8f3c05c7515e4753fdbf1e6c89ebadf36b36a537f0572450eb8246a8822c8366",
        "evidence_excerpt": "other, yet parallel. Thelaus entangled the moral and pragmatic arguments \naround piracy at a climactic moment in Sweden's imperial decline. In the \nyears immediately following his dissertation, these same arguments were \nentwined in formal debates within Sweden's halls of power.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
