        "evidence_excerpt": "Daniel Defoe's Captain Singleton (1720), Walter Scott's The Pirate (1822), \nJames Fenimore Cooper's The Red Rover (1827) and Robert Louis Stevenson's \nTreasure Island (1883), further adding to the popularity and aura of the \npirate in European culture.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "EXPLICIT_PARAGRAPH",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
