        "evidence_excerpt": "Stefan Eklóf Amirell is a Professor of Global History at Linnaeus University, \nSweden, and the Director ofthe Linnaeus University Centre for Concurrences \nin Colonial and Postcolonial Studies. His publications include Pirates in \nParadise: A Modern History of Southeast Asia's Maritime Marauders (2006) \nand Pirates of Empire: Colonisation and Maritime Violence in Southeast \nAsia (2019).",
