        "evidence_excerpt": "When  \"  the  Grand  Period  \"  came  to  an  end,  as \nit  did  about  the  date  already  indicated,  the  corsairs \nhad  become  a  permanent  institution ;  they  re- \nmained established  at  Algiers,  Tunis,  and  other \nports  on  the  littoral  of  Northern  Africa  as  a  recog- \nnised evil.  Pirates  they  remained  to  the  end  of",
