        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "certain  of  their  prey,  as  the  whole  length  and  breadth \nof  the  tideless  sea  was  sure  to  be  filled  with  the \nships  of  the  detested  Christians  trafficking  in  every \ndirection.  In  the  ethics  of  the  Moslem  all  ships \nwhich  sailed  under  the  banner  of  the  Cross,  no \nmatter  to  what  nation  they  belonged,  were  fair \ngame,  even  supposing  that  her  insignia  were  the \nCrescent — well,  supposing  the  spot  to  be  suffi- \nciently remote,  dead  men  tell  no  tales,  and  the \npirates  were  to  be  trusted  to  see  to  it  that  none \nescaped.",
