        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "hardened  men  of  blood  who  followed  in  the  train \nof  Barbarossa,  they  were  all  executed.  Even  this \nwholesale  massacre  did  not  assuage  the  wrath  of \nthe  corsair.  Standing  and  surveying  the  weltering \nshambles  which  tainted  the  air,  he  pulled  ferociously \nat  his  red  beard,  and  commanded  that  they  should \nwhip  Hassan  till  the  blood  ran ;  when  this  was \ndone  thoroughly  and  to  the  satisfaction  of  the \ndespot,  he  gave  orders  that  he  should  be  chained \nand  thrust  into  the  prison  of  the  fortress.",
