        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Who,  it  was  asked  in  Constantinople,  was  this \nman  who  had  been  called  in  to  command  the \nships  of  the  Ottomans  at  sea  ?  They  answered  their \nown  question,  and  said  that  he  was  a  lawless  man, \na  corsair :  were  there  not  good  seamen  and  valiant \nmen-at-arms  like  the  Bashas  Zay  and  Himeral,  who \nshould  be  preferred  before  him  ;  this  man  who  had",
