        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Muley  Hassan  was  further  made  to  contract  to \nhold  his  kingdom  in  fee  to  the  Spanish  Crown,  to \ncovenant  that  no  corsair  should  use  his  ports  for \nany  purpose  whatsoever,  that  the  Emperor  should \nnot  only  retain  the  Goletta  but  that  all  other \nfortified  seaports  should  be  put  into  his  hands,  that \nthe  King  of  Tunis  should  in  future  pay  twelve \nthousand  crowns  per  annum  for  the  subsistence  of \nthe  Spanish  garrison  of  the  Goletta,  that  he  should \nenter  into  no  alliance  with  the  enemies  of  the \nEmperor,  and  should  annually  present,  as  an  acknow- \nledgment of  his  vassalage,  six  Moorish  horses  and \nsix  hawks.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
