        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "The  council  on  which  the  corsair  had  been  engaged \nwhen  he  received  his  mortal  wound  had  for  its \nobject  the  complete  isolation  of  St.  Elmo  from  II \nBorgo ;  his  dispositions  were  completed  and  his \norders  given  to  the  engineer  just  before  he  was \nstruck.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
